            <title>[LU-21168] sanity test_413h: all objects created on MDT 0</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21168</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity test_413h fails with "all objects created on MDT 0": directories created round-robin with max-inherit-rr do not leave the parent MDT, all 80 subdirs end up on MDT0.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Log shows: MDT filesfree available: 395726 399876 401122 403199; MDT blocks available: 226988 497668 497524 499440; weight diff=124%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen on lustre-reviews:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class="alternate" type="square"&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;change 69798 ps5, 2026-11-09, review-ldiskfs-dne-arm, &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/0b818f1a-ad5d-4212-8689-f9e00d1b64e7" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/0b818f1a-ad5d-4212-8689-f9e00d1b64e7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;change 68160 ps47, 2026-11-07, review-ldiskfs-dne-arm, &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/085e4bd5-b7d3-413e-a505-6c501193d882" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/085e4bd5-b7d3-413e-a505-6c501193d882&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;change 70348 ps1, 2026-11-04, review-dne-selinux-ssk-part-1 ("test_413h returned 22"), &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/c94c92d5-fd3a-4a19-8bef-ca685ea64f1c" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/c94c92d5-fd3a-4a19-8bef-ca685ea64f1c&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Two or three failures since 2025-10-24, none ticketed, on unrelated changes from different uploaders. 69798 only touches sanityn 56a/56b and adds a ZFS helper, so it is not the cause. It fails together with sanity 413d (all 400 subdirs on MDT0) in the same runs, so the cause is likely shared.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-69798-ps5-8cf00c6b1b41 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/69798" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/69798&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
